---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout title="Company" description="HelTru is built in Estonia. GDPR-native, architecturally ready for the EU AI Act.">

  <section class="border-b border-mist-300">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-16 pb-16">
      <p class="eyebrow">Company</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight">Built in Estonia, for a problem that's the same everywhere.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-ink-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        HelTru started from a simple observation: the organizations responsible for watching over people
        (eldercare facilities, lone-worker employers, youth sports programs) are being asked to do it with fewer
        staff, not more. Continuous, privacy-preserving monitoring is the lever that doesn't require solving the
        staffing shortage first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-mist-300 ripple-field">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-14">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Why Estonia</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
            Estonia's digital-government infrastructure and e-residency ecosystem made it a natural base for a
            company whose entire value proposition rests on architecting privacy correctly from day one, inside
            the EU's own regulatory environment rather than adapting to it after the fact.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Why now</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
            The EU AI Act's phased obligations are arriving on a fixed timeline, and the staffing pressure across
            eldercare, healthcare, and frontline work is not reversing on its own. An architecture that is
            privacy-preserving and audit-ready by default, not by retrofit, is a better foundation to build six
            products on than one that treats compliance as a later milestone.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Pilot partnerships, investment conversations, and technical questions welcome.</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="btn-primary">Email {site.email}</a>
          <a href={`${base}/contact`} class="btn-secondary">Contact page</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
